{
  "success": true,
  "summary": "Added a main-branch GitHub Actions workflow that deploys the Dockerfile to Cloud Run with the former deploy.sh settings and documented the required GCP_SA_KEY secret.",
  "key_changes_made": [
    "Added .github/workflows/deploy.yml to auto-deploy to Cloud Run on main (and workflow_dispatch) using gcloud run deploy --source with 4Gi/2CPU/--no-cpu-throttling and defaults matching the old local deploy.sh project/region/service",
    "Rewrote .github/workflows/README.md to document the deploy workflow, required GCP_SA_KEY secret, optional GCP variables, and SA permission needs",
    "Updated web/USABILITY.md open items so Cloud Run CI/CD is marked as workflow-present but secret-blocked rather than missing"
  ],
  "key_learnings": [
    "A live Cloud Run publish still cannot run from this environment until repository secret GCP_SA_KEY is created; the workflow fails fast with that message instead of a cryptic auth error",
    "Remaining usability gaps are only the cosmetic 900px MathJax assistive bounding box and optional desktop playback-bar wrap; neither currently clips controls or widens documentElement.scrollWidth"
  ]
}
